+
+Show the Config
+---------------
+
+The :func:`config <cli.config_command>` command prints the application's
+configuration as JSON, which is useful to check which values are actually
+loaded. ::
+
+    $ flask --app hello config
+    {
+      "APPLICATION_ROOT": "/",
+      "DEBUG": false,
+      "SECRET_KEY": "***"
+    }
+
+The values of keys that look like they hold sensitive information, that is,
+keys containing ``SECRET``, ``PASSWORD``, ``TOKEN``, or ``KEY``, are masked as
+``"***"`` so that the output can be shared safely.
+
+
